---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Your Parts Cart | MAKHEX" description="Add individual ESP32 components or an entire project BOM. Cart planning is available, but payment checkout requires supplier verification.">
 <div class="container breadcrumb"><a href="/">HOME</a><span>/</span><span>PARTS CART</span></div>
 <section class="container cart-page">
  <div class="cart-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">MAKHEX / PARTS CART</span><h1>Build your kit.</h1><p>Collect components or add every part for a project in one click. Your cart is saved locally in this browser.</p></div><div class="cart-heading-side"><span data-cart-lines-count>Loading…</span><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">BROWSE BUILDS ↗</a></div></div>
  <div class="cart-body-grid">
   <div class="cart-lines" data-cart-lines aria-live="polite"><p>Loading parts…</p></div>
   <aside class="cart-summary"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR BUILD BASKET</span><h2>Parts summary</h2><strong class="cart-total" data-cart-total>Loading…</strong><p>One basket, one MAKHEX order. We source the components and handle supplier exceptions; you won't have to purchase from separate sellers.</p><a class="btn btn-primary cart-checkout" href="/checkout/">CHECK OUT WITH MAKHEX →</a><p class="cart-checkout-note">Your order is submitted to MAKHEX for review. No card payment is taken until sourcing exceptions and the final price are approved; payment is then completed securely with MAKHEX's Squarespace Payments checkout.</p><div class="cart-summary-actions"><button class="btn btn-outline" type="button" data-cart-copy>Copy parts list</button><button class="cart-clear" type="button" data-cart-clear>Clear cart</button></div><p data-cart-flash role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></aside>
  </div>
 </section>
<style>.cart-supplier-links{display:flex;gap:.35rem .8rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:.6rem 0}.cart-supplier-links a{font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.cart-line-info{min-width:0}</style>
</BaseLayout>
